1
00:00:56,298 --> 00:01:02,640
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:09,640
(The Ministry of Justice Prison)

3
00:01:23,349 --> 00:01:24,964
Clerk Shen, you must be careful.

4
00:01:29,357 --> 00:01:32,051
Your noble deeds will stay with me always.

5
00:01:32,197 --> 00:01:34,000
I promise to act with caution.

6
00:01:34,341 --> 00:01:36,007
If this proof can topple those corrupt officials

7
00:01:36,031 --> 00:01:37,405
and restore order to the court,

8
00:01:37,792 --> 00:01:39,286
then I can die without regrets.

9
00:01:40,735 --> 00:01:42,120
Take care, Clerk Shen.

10
00:01:48,735 --> 00:01:50,240
So, it was you

11
00:01:50,583 --> 00:01:52,077
who caused all of this.

12
00:01:52,934 --> 00:01:54,517
You've been lying to me this whole time.

13
00:01:54,541 --> 00:01:55,778
It wasn't me.

14
00:01:56,807 --> 00:01:58,044
It was you.

15
00:01:58,335 --> 00:02:00,680
You made His Majesty kill my father and brother!

16
00:02:01,167 --> 00:02:02,404
It wasn't me.

17
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:06,004
So, you were the one who got my father killed.

18
00:02:07,135 --> 00:02:08,708
You're no different from them.

19
00:02:09,534 --> 00:02:11,193
- All of you are murderers! - Murderers!

20
00:02:11,217 --> 00:02:12,807
- It was you! - It was you!

21
00:02:12,903 --> 00:02:14,960
It wasn't me!

22
00:02:15,524 --> 00:02:16,701
No.

23
00:02:16,798 --> 00:02:18,035
It wasn't me.

24
00:02:30,454 --> 00:02:31,691
Don't be scared.

25
00:02:32,494 --> 00:02:33,731
It's just a dream.

26
00:02:50,295 --> 00:02:52,240
(I don't smell special.)

27
00:02:52,854 --> 00:02:56,028
(When the Princess sleeps alone, she always has nightmares.)

28
00:02:56,318 --> 00:02:59,891
(Jian Xin said she'll be fine if Censor Shen is there.)

29
00:03:00,462 --> 00:03:04,037
(Make sure to stay by the Princess's side at night.)

30
00:03:04,654 --> 00:03:06,428
(So you want me here)

31
00:03:09,458 --> 00:03:12,072
(because I can chase away your nightmares.)

32
00:03:14,214 --> 00:03:15,509
(You're too tired.)

33
00:03:16,094 --> 00:03:17,640
(Just sleep well.)

34
00:03:18,390 --> 00:03:20,600
(I promise those nightmares)

35
00:03:21,335 --> 00:03:23,160
(will fade away someday.)

36
00:03:53,702 --> 00:03:54,939
Zhao Yang!

37
00:04:24,286 --> 00:04:25,740
The Eastern Palace assassins.

38
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:27,476
Their clothes and weapons are proof.

39
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:30,340
A capital crime of killing one's own kin. I'll see His Majesty at once.

40
00:04:30,653 --> 00:04:32,148
I'll take care of the bodies.

41
00:04:33,638 --> 00:04:36,760
Since I'm here, I won't let the Eastern Palace take the blame.

42
00:04:40,014 --> 00:04:42,361
I'll admit to stealing those 500,000 bushels of grain.

43
00:04:45,494 --> 00:04:46,731
You want to take the blame?

44
00:04:47,055 --> 00:04:48,975
Do you even know what crime you're admitting to?

45
00:04:50,254 --> 00:04:51,414
I'll admit it.

46
00:04:51,517 --> 00:04:53,095
It's the Cui family hoarding state resources.

47
00:04:53,119 --> 00:04:54,533
That crime doesn't warrant death.

48
00:04:54,855 --> 00:04:56,869
You have no place left in the Eastern Palace.

49
00:04:57,206 --> 00:04:59,110
If you report the Crown Prince for killing his own kin,

50
00:04:59,134 --> 00:05:00,542
you're signing your own death warrant.

51
00:05:00,566 --> 00:05:02,849
Let this matter end here.

52
00:05:05,694 --> 00:05:06,931
Shen Xiao.

53
00:05:07,462 --> 00:05:08,876
If you really want to protect her,

54
00:05:09,350 --> 00:05:10,869
then let things go right now.

55
00:05:10,965 --> 00:05:13,280
Getting her out safely is your best move.

56
00:05:40,878 --> 00:05:43,240
Chief Commandant of Yulin, Cui Jin Zhi,

57
00:05:43,478 --> 00:05:46,079
stood by during the crisis and hoarded grain.

58
00:05:46,215 --> 00:05:47,477
He failed to discipline his men.

59
00:05:47,501 --> 00:05:50,635
He is hereby stripped of his Chief Commandant title.

60
00:05:50,942 --> 00:05:53,102
He will temporarily keep his title as the Prince Consort.

61
00:05:53,126 --> 00:05:54,711
His salary will be docked for three years.

62
00:05:54,735 --> 00:05:56,509
Let this serve as a warning to others.

63
00:05:59,946 --> 00:06:02,361
Thank you for His Majesty's grace.

64
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:07,435
Here's another decree for Censor Shen Xiao.

65
00:06:20,014 --> 00:06:23,429
Censor Shen investigated the Yongtong Canal case thoroughly,

66
00:06:23,615 --> 00:06:25,074
showing loyalty and diligence.

67
00:06:25,197 --> 00:06:27,727
He is granted the right to submit secret memorials directly.

68
00:06:27,894 --> 00:06:30,707
His memorials will go straight to His Majesty.

69
00:06:33,807 --> 00:06:36,021
Thank you for your grace, Your Majesty.

70
00:06:37,694 --> 00:06:40,535
Shen Xiao, I ordered you to collect grains.

71
00:06:40,654 --> 00:06:43,415
In the end, even though you didn't get the grains through collection,

72
00:06:43,501 --> 00:06:46,885
I still consider it your accomplishment.

73
00:06:48,693 --> 00:06:49,946
My loyal ministers.

74
00:06:50,535 --> 00:06:54,060
The Cui family has been a pillar of the Ye Dynasty since its founding.

75
00:06:54,245 --> 00:06:55,662
All of you petitioned to protect him.

76
00:06:55,686 --> 00:06:57,155
So I gave him a lighter sentence.

77
00:06:57,334 --> 00:06:58,975
But if every noble family

78
00:06:59,110 --> 00:07:02,080
relies on their ancestors' achievements to cover up their mistakes,

79
00:07:02,964 --> 00:07:05,538
the Ye Dynasty won't survive.

80
00:07:06,677 --> 00:07:09,492
Repairing the Yongtong Canal is my command.

81
00:07:10,454 --> 00:07:11,989
If anyone causes trouble again,

82
00:07:12,563 --> 00:07:14,298
I will punish them severely.

83
00:07:24,535 --> 00:07:26,108
(When Cui Jin Zhi was punished, )

84
00:07:26,254 --> 00:07:27,974
(all the noble families finally understood)

85
00:07:28,014 --> 00:07:30,760
(that even the Prince Consort can be punished.)

86
00:07:31,334 --> 00:07:34,468
(And with His Majesty openly threatening them in court, )

87
00:07:34,582 --> 00:07:36,598
(all the noble families donated the grains themselves)

88
00:07:36,622 --> 00:07:38,476
(without needing any urging.)

89
00:07:39,071 --> 00:07:40,644
(Now, the Yongtong Canal)

90
00:07:40,789 --> 00:07:43,243
(can finally be repaired properly.)

91
00:07:49,254 --> 00:07:50,573
Congratulations, Censor Shen.

92
00:07:50,703 --> 00:07:53,643
You've become a trusted minister of the Emperor. You've earned it.

93
00:07:55,142 --> 00:07:57,680
Greetings, Seventh Prince.

94
00:07:58,629 --> 00:08:00,803
I shouldn't have kept my identity a secret from you.

95
00:08:01,805 --> 00:08:03,859
You should've been more secretive about it.

96
00:08:04,645 --> 00:08:06,778
When you rule the nation someday,

97
00:08:07,003 --> 00:08:08,698
you could surprise me then.

98
00:08:09,255 --> 00:08:10,492
Are you not mad?

99
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:12,067
Not at all.

100
00:08:12,981 --> 00:08:15,127
My best friend is the Seventh Prince.

101
00:08:15,287 --> 00:08:17,280
He'll be the ruler of the nation one day.

102
00:08:17,901 --> 00:08:19,516
That's truly an honor for me.

103
00:08:20,613 --> 00:08:22,560
I told you Censor Shen wouldn't get mad.

104
00:08:23,148 --> 00:08:24,948
You insisted on coming to apologize yourself.

105
00:08:25,454 --> 00:08:26,709
You are here too.

106
00:08:28,498 --> 00:08:30,354
All my grains have been delivered.

107
00:08:30,438 --> 00:08:32,670
Of course I have to watch over them myself to feel at ease.

108
00:08:32,694 --> 00:08:35,788
In case you catch me slipping up and report me straight to His Majesty.

109
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:43,840
If there's a next time, I'll definitely prepare a clean blanket for you.

110
00:08:44,982 --> 00:08:46,519
You want there to be a next time?

111
00:08:51,958 --> 00:08:54,154
Sister, you two...

112
00:08:57,780 --> 00:09:00,760
I'm Censor Shen's creditor.

113
00:09:01,749 --> 00:09:04,769
After all, that official robe of his cost me 80,000 bushels of grain.

114
00:09:05,402 --> 00:09:07,935
But you got almost a million bushels from the noble families.

115
00:09:08,261 --> 00:09:10,680
You definitely came out ahead on this deal.

116
00:09:19,062 --> 00:09:20,357
I, Shen Xiao,

117
00:09:21,094 --> 00:09:23,068
on behalf of the countless people of Ye,

118
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:25,600
thank you once again, Your Highness.

119
00:09:33,846 --> 00:09:35,720
Now that the Yongtong Canal is open,

120
00:09:36,055 --> 00:09:38,240
it's a complete falling-out with the Eastern Palace.

121
00:09:38,702 --> 00:09:40,485
The Crown Prince's foundation is still solid.

122
00:09:40,509 --> 00:09:41,803
He'll definitely strike back.

123
00:09:46,494 --> 00:09:47,731
Le Sheng.

124
00:09:48,495 --> 00:09:50,188
Under the guise of making maps,

125
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,040
keep contacting the royals and neutral officials in secret.

126
00:09:53,295 --> 00:09:54,532
Build up your reputation.

127
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:58,040
Shen Xiao, besides overseeing Yongtong Canal,

128
00:09:58,213 --> 00:10:00,174
use your right to submit reports directly

129
00:10:00,310 --> 00:10:01,963
to secure your position at court.

130
00:10:02,214 --> 00:10:04,334
You two, with one in the shadows and one in the open,

131
00:10:04,421 --> 00:10:06,755
maybe we can find a chance to survive.

132
00:10:08,813 --> 00:10:10,035
Understood.

133
00:10:39,971 --> 00:10:41,746
For a woman,

134
00:10:42,606 --> 00:10:45,381
you've ruined the Cui family's legacy built over a century.

135
00:10:46,583 --> 00:10:48,196
If your father were here,

136
00:10:49,022 --> 00:10:52,197
he'd personally beat you to death for being an unfilial son!

137
00:10:55,719 --> 00:10:58,560
If you mess up again

138
00:10:58,750 --> 00:11:00,480
and bring shame to the family,

139
00:11:00,997 --> 00:11:02,637
you'll be erased from the family records.

140
00:11:02,694 --> 00:11:05,040
You'll never be allowed back into the clan!

141
00:11:06,518 --> 00:11:08,532
You'd better watch yourself.

142
00:11:29,263 --> 00:11:30,500
Prince Consort.

143
00:11:30,614 --> 00:11:33,709
His Highness has asked me to deliver a message.

144
00:11:34,934 --> 00:11:36,709
Your actions today

145
00:11:36,814 --> 00:11:39,229
were honestly disappointing.

146
00:11:40,094 --> 00:11:41,880
His Highness trusted you,

147
00:11:42,214 --> 00:11:45,469
helped restore your family's honor,

148
00:11:45,870 --> 00:11:48,405
but you destroyed your own foundation.

149
00:11:52,167 --> 00:11:53,600
I am guilty of that.

150
00:11:55,295 --> 00:11:57,989
But I did it to help the Eastern Palace.

151
00:11:59,175 --> 00:12:01,360
Even if Zhao Yang is no longer favored,

152
00:12:01,796 --> 00:12:03,980
if she dies suddenly in prison, His Majesty will investigate it.

153
00:12:04,004 --> 00:12:05,650
But what His Highness wants

154
00:12:05,895 --> 00:12:08,869
is a clean solution to end all future troubles!

155
00:12:09,919 --> 00:12:11,440
Tell His Highness

156
00:12:11,814 --> 00:12:15,349
I swear on my father's spirit in heaven

157
00:12:15,614 --> 00:12:19,028
that I absolutely have no intention of ever defying Your Highness again.

158
00:12:20,094 --> 00:12:22,068
But Zhao Yang is my wife.

159
00:12:23,295 --> 00:12:24,413
Her life

160
00:12:24,854 --> 00:12:26,091
should be in my hands.

161
00:12:27,983 --> 00:12:31,317
Thank you for His Highness's mercy.

162
00:12:34,015 --> 00:12:37,722
I'll pass that on myself.

163
00:12:54,767 --> 00:12:56,861
That Cui Jin Zhi.

164
00:12:57,997 --> 00:12:59,692
For a woman,

165
00:13:00,518 --> 00:13:02,492
you cast aside

166
00:13:02,859 --> 00:13:05,534
even your family's fate and my grand plans.

167
00:13:06,272 --> 00:13:07,925
Lust has clouded your judgment.

168
00:13:10,495 --> 00:13:12,869
He actually wants to save Zhao Yang's life.

169
00:13:27,413 --> 00:13:28,650
Your Highness.

170
00:13:30,055 --> 00:13:31,183
Who is he?

171
00:13:32,606 --> 00:13:34,640
He used to work in the Ministry of Revenue.

172
00:13:35,383 --> 00:13:37,600
He's an old colleague of Shen Qing Zhi.

173
00:13:38,655 --> 00:13:40,552
I've always had doubts.

174
00:13:41,055 --> 00:13:42,760
Shen Qing Zhi is just a clerk.

175
00:13:42,884 --> 00:13:45,708
How did he get so much evidence against the Eastern Palace?

176
00:13:46,334 --> 00:13:48,759
So I secretly sent someone to find this man.

177
00:13:52,094 --> 00:13:53,800
Your Highness, I only know

178
00:13:53,935 --> 00:13:55,815
that Shen Qing Zhi once met Princess Zhao Yang.

179
00:13:55,951 --> 00:13:57,188
I don't know anything else.

180
00:14:08,031 --> 00:14:09,485
What did you say?

181
00:14:11,567 --> 00:14:13,727
Your Highness, please believe me. I wouldn't dare lie.

182
00:14:13,837 --> 00:14:15,074
I speak the truth.

183
00:14:17,015 --> 00:14:18,252
Take him away.

184
00:14:18,574 --> 00:14:21,188
Your Highness, please spare me! Your Highness!

185
00:14:21,767 --> 00:14:23,004
Your Highness!

186
00:14:24,757 --> 00:14:27,571
- Your Highness. - Zhao Yang has always been plotting against us.

187
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:31,869
Your Highness, Zhao Yang has turned against the Eastern Palace.

188
00:14:31,998 --> 00:14:33,293
This threat must be eliminated.

189
00:14:34,495 --> 00:14:36,360
Since Cui Jin Zhi has softened toward her,

190
00:14:36,541 --> 00:14:38,595
he can't handle this matter anymore.

191
00:14:43,223 --> 00:14:44,600
Do it cleanly.

192
00:14:45,334 --> 00:14:46,840
Yes, Your Highness.

193
00:14:55,495 --> 00:14:56,670
(Your Highness.)

194
00:14:56,814 --> 00:14:59,360
(There's something at Qianfo Temple that concerns you.)

195
00:14:59,791 --> 00:15:01,605
(I'll wait for you at the temple.)

196
00:15:04,135 --> 00:15:06,508
Bad luck, go away.

197
00:15:06,646 --> 00:15:09,020
Bad people, go away.

198
00:15:09,214 --> 00:15:11,654
Bodhisattva, please bless our princess

199
00:15:11,797 --> 00:15:14,692
so that she'll never get locked up again.

200
00:15:20,495 --> 00:15:21,732
Censor Shen.

201
00:15:22,668 --> 00:15:24,869
Bad people, go away.

202
00:15:26,135 --> 00:15:28,428
Bad people, go away.

203
00:15:28,959 --> 00:15:32,709
Did you invite me to Qianfo Temple to discuss something important?

204
00:15:34,679 --> 00:15:35,835
Yes.

205
00:15:36,005 --> 00:15:38,120
But I only invited you.

206
00:15:39,687 --> 00:15:42,340
Bringing them along can avoid suspicion.

207
00:15:43,895 --> 00:15:45,894
Bad luck, go away.

208
00:15:45,997 --> 00:15:48,292
Bad people, go away.

209
00:15:48,535 --> 00:15:50,548
Bodhisattva, bless us.

210
00:15:52,112 --> 00:15:53,349
Xiao Que.

211
00:15:53,494 --> 00:15:55,280
Can you go play by yourself for a bit?

212
00:15:55,495 --> 00:15:57,415
Let me talk to Her Highness alone.

213
00:15:57,566 --> 00:16:00,680
I'm not going. I want to play with Her Highness.

214
00:16:04,941 --> 00:16:07,395
It's like giving a flirty glance to a blind man.

215
00:16:08,645 --> 00:16:09,882
Xiao Que.

216
00:16:10,055 --> 00:16:13,220
The temple has prepared delicious vegetarian food for Her Highness.

217
00:16:13,415 --> 00:16:14,695
If you're late, they'll be gone.

218
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:16,216
Really? Your Highness,

219
00:16:16,327 --> 00:16:18,099
I'll go and check it out first.

220
00:16:22,655 --> 00:16:24,191
I'll get going first.

221
00:16:24,319 --> 00:16:25,959
Censor Shen, Your Highness,

222
00:16:26,121 --> 00:16:27,495
take your time talking.

223
00:16:33,015 --> 00:16:34,320
What do you have to say

224
00:16:34,453 --> 00:16:35,915
that even they can't hear?

225
00:16:40,654 --> 00:16:42,360
I would like to ask you

226
00:16:42,654 --> 00:16:44,388
to draw a fortune stick with me.

227
00:16:47,878 --> 00:16:49,320
You're acting weird.

228
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:52,532
Did you call me here just to draw a fortune stick?

229
00:16:53,494 --> 00:16:55,959
Well, we're already here. Why not draw one?

230
00:16:58,255 --> 00:16:59,814
I don't believe in the higher power.

231
00:16:59,933 --> 00:17:01,093
I only believe in myself.

232
00:17:01,216 --> 00:17:02,734
My fate is in my own hands.

233
00:17:02,885 --> 00:17:04,125
Why bother with fortune sticks?

234
00:17:04,814 --> 00:17:06,613
Fine. Then I'll draw one.

235
00:17:22,038 --> 00:17:25,691
How much longer until Her Highness comes to eat?

236
00:17:28,015 --> 00:17:29,252
Just wait.

237
00:17:29,632 --> 00:17:32,326
(Censor Shen won't let her go so soon.)

238
00:17:45,894 --> 00:17:48,480
Xiao Que, you can't eat that.

239
00:17:49,134 --> 00:17:51,490
I can. This one fell on the ground.

240
00:17:51,571 --> 00:17:53,254
The Princess definitely can't eat it now.

241
00:17:53,414 --> 00:17:55,227
But we can't waste food.

242
00:17:55,534 --> 00:17:58,360
I used to be so hungry, I'd even eat tree bark.

243
00:17:59,991 --> 00:18:01,591
If I hadn't met the Princess,

244
00:18:01,718 --> 00:18:05,091
I probably would've starved to death long ago.

245
00:18:07,477 --> 00:18:09,092
Xiao Que, come here.

246
00:18:13,455 --> 00:18:15,108
Xiao Que, eat this fresh one.

247
00:18:15,726 --> 00:18:19,560
No way. We have to wait for the Princess to eat the ones on the table.

248
00:18:34,107 --> 00:18:36,992
(Great Fortune)

249
00:18:54,495 --> 00:18:57,080
Li Shu, I have something to tell you.

250
00:18:58,735 --> 00:18:59,972
What did you just call me?

251
00:19:05,878 --> 00:19:07,115
Li Shu.

252
00:19:10,598 --> 00:19:11,835
Xiao Que!

253
00:19:12,215 --> 00:19:14,828
Xiao Que.

254
00:19:15,215 --> 00:19:17,292
What's wrong with you?

255
00:19:19,414 --> 00:19:20,651
Xiao Que!

256
00:19:20,775 --> 00:19:22,012
Xiao Que.

257
00:19:22,535 --> 00:19:23,772
Xiao Que.

258
00:19:25,255 --> 00:19:26,415
Xiao Que.

259
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:27,747
Xiao Que.

260
00:19:28,094 --> 00:19:29,331
What's going on?

261
00:19:32,286 --> 00:19:33,523
Xiao Que!

262
00:19:34,535 --> 00:19:35,772
What's going on?

263
00:19:36,342 --> 00:19:37,796
I think she's poisoned.

264
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:40,307
The veggie bun.

265
00:19:40,677 --> 00:19:42,131
She ate the veggie bun.

266
00:19:50,215 --> 00:19:51,879
Xiao Que.

267
00:19:51,986 --> 00:19:53,144
Xiao Que.

268
00:19:55,581 --> 00:19:57,275
Am I poisoned?

269
00:19:57,678 --> 00:20:00,452
Am I going to die?

270
00:20:03,717 --> 00:20:04,954
No.

271
00:20:05,383 --> 00:20:06,620
You won't die.

272
00:20:07,407 --> 00:20:09,200
Go and get the imperial physician now!

273
00:20:13,255 --> 00:20:16,280
Your Highness, don't be sad.

274
00:20:16,894 --> 00:20:19,828
If I can die with a full stomach,

275
00:20:20,590 --> 00:20:23,912
that'll be the happiest thing ever.

276
00:20:26,495 --> 00:20:27,732
No, you won't.

277
00:20:28,935 --> 00:20:30,669
You won't die.

278
00:20:30,872 --> 00:20:32,738
Has your bad luck

279
00:20:32,851 --> 00:20:34,680
been cleared?

280
00:20:40,167 --> 00:20:41,621
It's all gone.

281
00:20:43,199 --> 00:20:44,880
Thanks to you.

282
00:20:45,174 --> 00:20:47,628
That's good then.

283
00:20:56,260 --> 00:20:57,497
Xiao Que.

284
00:20:58,894 --> 00:21:00,131
Xiao Que.

285
00:21:10,843 --> 00:21:12,178
Go away.

286
00:21:12,535 --> 00:21:14,431
If someone of low-born status learns to read or write,

287
00:21:14,455 --> 00:21:16,120
it's considered overstepping their place.

288
00:21:16,526 --> 00:21:18,300
No wonder you're so scared.

289
00:21:18,999 --> 00:21:20,720
The Princess is precious.

290
00:21:20,944 --> 00:21:22,680
Make sure nothing happens to her.

291
00:21:22,761 --> 00:21:24,800
Not even a scratch.

292
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:26,894
Or lose even a bit of weight.

293
00:21:26,975 --> 00:21:29,788
Otherwise, I won't forgive you!

294
00:21:30,151 --> 00:21:31,311
When the Princess drinks tea,

295
00:21:31,352 --> 00:21:33,192
she needs to eat golden milk pastries with it.

296
00:21:33,278 --> 00:21:36,800
They must be freshly made from Yuyi Pastry House.

297
00:21:55,022 --> 00:21:56,259
Xiao Que.

298
00:21:58,786 --> 00:21:59,915
Xiao Que.

299
00:22:11,966 --> 00:22:13,600
Every dish is poisoned.

300
00:22:13,854 --> 00:22:15,560
This was meant for you.

301
00:22:15,983 --> 00:22:17,360
We can't stay here any longer.

302
00:22:17,542 --> 00:22:18,779
Let's go!

303
00:22:25,661 --> 00:22:27,462
Your Highness, the temple is surrounded.

304
00:22:27,566 --> 00:22:29,179
We'll take Xiao Que out the side door.

305
00:22:36,294 --> 00:22:37,531
Go!

306
00:22:40,094 --> 00:22:41,331
Your Highness.

307
00:22:43,854 --> 00:22:45,388
I'll carry Xiao Que.

308
00:22:50,215 --> 00:22:51,680
I'll take you out.

309
00:22:51,894 --> 00:22:53,269
I will get you out.

310
00:22:56,920 --> 00:23:01,000
(Qianfo Temple)

311
00:23:03,341 --> 00:23:05,234
Hurry! Don't let them get away!

312
00:23:10,344 --> 00:23:12,478
Jian Xin, we're not far from Le Sheng.

313
00:23:12,629 --> 00:23:15,260
Take the kid to him. Have him call for reinforcements.

314
00:23:15,380 --> 00:23:16,699
I'll help Her Highness escape.

315
00:23:16,804 --> 00:23:19,280
- But... - There's no time. Hurry!

316
00:23:58,109 --> 00:23:59,960
You're from the Eastern Palace.

317
00:24:06,798 --> 00:24:08,035
Impressive.

318
00:24:09,381 --> 00:24:11,036
That was really impressive.

319
00:24:11,887 --> 00:24:15,060
I just wanted to clean house and send my royal sister off.

320
00:24:15,639 --> 00:24:18,933
But I didn't expect to get Censor Shen as a bonus.

321
00:24:22,535 --> 00:24:24,175
Crown Prince, what are you doing?

322
00:24:24,381 --> 00:24:25,861
About those 500,000 bushels of grain,

323
00:24:26,320 --> 00:24:27,614
I didn't know

324
00:24:27,782 --> 00:24:29,675
Cui Jin Zhi would take the blame for me either.

325
00:24:30,695 --> 00:24:32,229
Zhao Yang.

326
00:24:33,439 --> 00:24:35,052
My dear sister.

327
00:24:35,215 --> 00:24:36,720
All these years,

328
00:24:37,055 --> 00:24:39,484
you've acted so obedient in front of me,

329
00:24:39,614 --> 00:24:41,440
pretending to be greedy and lustful.

330
00:24:41,589 --> 00:24:42,800
You fooled me

331
00:24:43,006 --> 00:24:45,040
and the Eastern Palace.

332
00:24:45,631 --> 00:24:47,125
You must feel proud.

333
00:24:49,055 --> 00:24:51,269
What I hate most is betrayal.

334
00:24:52,030 --> 00:24:53,267
And you

335
00:24:53,455 --> 00:24:56,989
are an ungrateful wolf I can't tame.

336
00:24:57,595 --> 00:24:58,832
Today,

337
00:24:59,654 --> 00:25:02,042
I'm going to watch you die.

338
00:25:08,894 --> 00:25:10,614
I didn't expect this from you, Censor Shen.

339
00:25:11,814 --> 00:25:13,051
Interesting.

340
00:25:14,885 --> 00:25:16,819
You all are really interesting.

341
00:25:17,535 --> 00:25:20,080
Censor Shen, you are risking your life to protect her.

342
00:25:20,205 --> 00:25:22,320
Do you actually have feelings for her?

343
00:25:23,414 --> 00:25:25,000
Do you even know

344
00:25:25,222 --> 00:25:27,196
what kind of person Zhao Yang really is?

345
00:25:27,495 --> 00:25:28,732
Do you know

346
00:25:30,455 --> 00:25:33,280
who caused your father's death?

347
00:25:33,535 --> 00:25:35,989
My father found solid proof of your corruption.

348
00:25:36,374 --> 00:25:38,028
You silenced him.

349
00:25:42,766 --> 00:25:44,899
So you aren't as clueless as I thought.

350
00:25:45,423 --> 00:25:47,222
But where did

351
00:25:47,397 --> 00:25:49,160
those so-called ironclad proofs come from?

352
00:25:53,175 --> 00:25:57,040
From Princess Zhao Yang, whom you are risking everything to protect.

353
00:25:58,614 --> 00:25:59,851
She

354
00:26:00,431 --> 00:26:04,710
personally handed those ironclad proofs to your father herself.

355
00:26:05,535 --> 00:26:06,772
Shen Xiao.

356
00:26:07,015 --> 00:26:08,840
About your father's death,

357
00:26:09,534 --> 00:26:13,067
she played a huge part in it.

358
00:26:26,173 --> 00:26:27,410
Shen Xiao.

359
00:26:27,662 --> 00:26:28,899
Even now,

360
00:26:30,298 --> 00:26:32,205
are you still willing to risk your life for her?

361
00:26:32,229 --> 00:26:33,522
Li Chong.

362
00:26:34,455 --> 00:26:36,348
You're the real culprit here!

363
00:26:36,550 --> 00:26:37,787
Zhao Yang.

364
00:26:38,614 --> 00:26:39,920
You're asking for death.

365
00:26:46,086 --> 00:26:47,323
Shen Xiao!
